===== ES8311 SEPARATE-TRANSFER READS, 100 KHZ =====

nsh> i2c get -b0 -a18 -f100000 -rfd -s
READ Bus: 0 Addr: 18 Subaddr: fd Value: 83

nsh> i2c get -b0 -a18 -f100000 -rfe -s
READ Bus: 0 Addr: 18 Subaddr: fe Value: 11

nsh> i2c get -b0 -a18 -f100000 -rff -s
READ Bus: 0 Addr: 18 Subaddr: ff Value: 01

===== ES8311 REPEATED-START READS =====

nsh> i2c get -b0 -a18 -f10000 -rfd
READ Bus: 0 Addr: 18 Subaddr: fd Value: 83

nsh> i2c get -b0 -a18 -f100000 -rfd
READ Bus: 0 Addr: 18 Subaddr: fd Value: 83

===== RESULT =====

PASS NSH boot and command prompt
